This project uses Kubernetes API definitions, apimachinery and client-go,
which are licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

YAML parsing uses go.yaml.in/yaml/v3 and sigs.k8s.io/yaml. Dependency versions
and their transitive modules are recorded in go.mod and go.sum. Each dependency
retains its own copyright and license. Release packages include dependency
license texts generated from the exact module graph.

Authorization behavior is implemented against the Kubernetes RBAC semantics
and verified against the Kubernetes API server. Upstream references are listed
in docs/design.zh-CN.md.

The ExternalDNS example includes configuration from kubernetes-sigs/external-dns
v0.15.1, commit c55b1a1127df024b95f927869a1bcd662ec4337a. The Apache-2.0
license and file-level provenance are included under examples/external-dns/.
The candidate Secret-read rule in that example was authored for GrantDiff.

The kube-state-metrics example includes configuration from
kubernetes/kube-state-metrics v2.14.0, commit
e763ea2aa37e7fa507775a8506387aaa95ff17d1. Its Apache-2.0 license and source
hashes are included under examples/kube-state-metrics/. The candidate removal
of Secret observation was authored for GrantDiff.
